# Re-render the contact panel from the hand-positioned session after editing
# fix_sidechains.cxc.
#
#     ChimeraX recapture_contact.cxc      (GUI: no OpenGL under --nogui on macOS)
#
# NO camera changes and NOTHING hidden. The panel is the same view as the
# overview panels, at the same camera, and the close-up is made afterwards by
# cropping the saved PNG in crop_contact.py. Earlier versions re-aimed the
# camera and hid the distant cartoon, which left white space behind the contact
# and cut the complex off.

close session
open d26_s1_contact.cxs
open fix_sidechains.cxc
save renders/panel_d_contact_full.png width 4800 supersample 3 transparentBackground true
exit
